---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout
  title="Septic System Design Yavapai County AZ | Diaz Environmental LLC"
  description="ADEQ-certified septic design and percolation testing in Yavapai County AZ. Serving Prescott, Prescott Valley, Chino Valley, Dewey & surrounding areas. Call (602) 812-8609."
  canonical="https://diazenviroaz.com/septic-yavapai-county"
>
  <main class="service-page">
    <section class="service-hero">
      <h1>Septic System Services in Yavapai County, AZ</h1>
      <p>ADEQ-certified septic system design, soil evaluation and percolation testing throughout Yavapai County. Serving Prescott, Prescott Valley, Chino Valley and surrounding areas.</p>
      <a href="/#contact" class="btn">Get a Free Quote</a>
    </section>
    <section class="service-body">
      <h2>Septic Services in Yavapai County</h2>
      <p>Yavapai County covers a vast stretch of central Arizona from the high-altitude forests of Prescott to the desert communities south toward Wickenburg. Much of this county is rural and unserved by municipal sewer — making properly designed and permitted septic systems essential for both new construction and existing properties.</p>

      <h2>Communities We Serve in Yavapai County</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Prescott</li>
        <li>Prescott Valley</li>
        <li>Chino Valley</li>
        <li>Dewey-Humboldt</li>
        <li>Wickenburg</li>
        <li>Congress</li>
        <li>Mayer</li>
        <li>Crown King</li>
        <li>Cordes Lakes</li>
        <li>Paulden</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Yavapai County Soil Conditions</h2>
      <p>Yavapai County presents unique challenges for septic system design. The granite and rocky soils around Prescott, the clay-heavy conditions in Prescott Valley, and the sandy desert soils near Wickenburg all require different engineering approaches. Our team is experienced with the full range of Yavapai County soil profiles and ADEQ requirements.</p>

      <h2>Fast Turnaround for Yavapai County Projects</h2>
      <p>Despite serving a wide geographic area, we maintain our 3–5 business day turnaround for soil testing, design, and permit submission. We coordinate directly with Yavapai County Environmental Services to expedite the permitting process.</p>

      <h2>Servicios Sépticos en el Condado de Yavapai</h2>
      <p>Diaz Environmental brinda servicios de diseño séptico certificado por ADEQ, pruebas de percolación y gestión de permisos en todo el Condado de Yavapai, incluyendo Prescott, Prescott Valley, Chino Valley, Wickenburg y más. ¡Somos bilingües y respondemos el mismo día!</p>
    </section>
    <section class="service-cta">
      <h2>Serving All of Yavapai County, AZ</h2>
      <p>Call <a href="tel:6028128609">(602) 812-8609</a> — free consultation guaranteed.</p>
      <a href="/#contact" class="btn">Contact Us Today</a>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
<style>
  .service-page { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 4rem 2rem; font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; }
  .service-hero { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 4rem; }
  .service-hero h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 800; color: #154a2a; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .service-hero p { font-size: 1.1rem; color: #555; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .service-body h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #154a2a; margin: 2rem 0 1rem; }
  .service-body p { color: #444; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .service-body ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .service-body ul li { padding: 0.4rem 0 0.4rem 1.5rem; position: relative; color: #444; }
  .service-body ul li::before { content: "✓"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: #154a2a; font-weight: 700; }
  .service-cta { text-align: center; background: #f0f7f2; border-radius: 12px; padding: 3rem 2rem; margin-top: 4rem; }
  .service-cta h2 { font-size: 1.6rem; color: #154a2a; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .service-cta p { color: #555; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .service-cta a[href^="tel"] { color: #154a2a; font-weight: 700; }
  .btn { display: inline-block; background: #154a2a; color: white; padding: 13px 30px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; transition: background 0.3s; }
  .btn:hover { background: #0d3019; }
</style>